index.html:114:      <div class="help-card"><button class="close-modal" id="help-close">×</button><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> FIELD NOTES</div><h2>HOW TO MOVE</h2><p><b>W A S D</b> to walk · <b>SHIFT</b> to run · Move your mouse to look around · <b>E</b> to interact. On touch screens, use the on-screen controls and drag to look.</p><p>Buildings and parked cars are solid. Follow the neon and enter through lit doorways. Inside you will find terminals, crowded rooms, and people with stories. Get close to a cat and press <b>E</b> to pet it. Birds will scatter if you approach. The <b>−</b> on the field map shrinks it, and <b>M</b> collapses the directive.</p><p>The city is divided into three tiers. Each tier answers a different puzzle: tones in the Low Quarter, promises in the Middle Tier, power routing in the Spire. Solve them in order and the perimeter gate will open.</p><button class="primary-button" id="resume-button"><span>BACK TO THE CITY</span><b>↗</b></button></div>
