Lever: place at x=8.0, z=z+2.4 (south side, accessible from player's current side approaching from south? For gate A, player comes from z>10 (north? Coordinate: Low Quarter is z>10, moving toward -z to checkpoint z8.4. So south side in world is +z. Gate A lever at z+2.4 = 12.4, in Low Quarter, accessible before opening. Good. For gate B at z=-22, player comes from middle z>-22, also +z side. lever z=-19.6. Good.)

