- But gate blocker is across x -9.7..9.7 with wings blocking x -17..-9.8 and 9.8..17. At z=10 the road+sidewalk fully blocked between buildings. Player can still go around via x<-17? Archive building x-38..-16 sits at z6..22, so at z=10, going around archive west side requires x<-38, possible via open area, but buildings may block. Fine.

