"gate opening point ... lever that can only be accessed after all puzzles solved." For chapter gates, lever accessible after relevant relay; for final perimeter gate, lever only after all 3. Let's add final lever at (7.6, -68.2) near perimeter gate; guard with `solved.size===3`. Interact type 'gateLever' id 'perimeterLever'. Its `gate` references perimeter. Use separate handling.

